   "q": "<p>Bir çayır ekosistemine ait besin ağı aşağıda verilmiştir. Oklar enerjinin aktarım yönünü göstermektedir.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 265\" width=\"380\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Çayır ekosistemi besin ağı\">\n<defs><marker id=\"web1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#334155\"/></marker></defs>\n<line x1=\"176\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"94\" y2=\"187\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"200\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"187\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"224\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"187\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"70\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"107\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"163\" y2=\"175\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"88\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"142\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"196\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"210\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"197\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"273\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<line x1=\"328\" y1=\"163\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" marker-end=\"url(#web1)\"/>\n<rect x=\"163\" y=\"228\" width=\"74\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#166534\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ot</text>\n<rect x=\"33\" y=\"163\" width=\"74\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fef08a\" stroke=\"#b45309\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Çekirge</text>\n<rect x=\"163\" y=\"163\" width=\"74\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fef08a\" stroke=\"#b45309\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fare</text>\n<rect x=\"293\" y=\"163\" width=\"74\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fef08a\" stroke=\"#b45309\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"179\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tavşan</text>\n<rect x=\"33\" y=\"88\" width=\"74\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" stroke=\"#c2410c\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Kurbağa</text>\n<rect x=\"123\" y=\"28\" width=\"74\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Yılan</text>\n<rect x=\"273\" y=\"28\" width=\"74\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Şahin</text>\n</svg></div>\n<p>Bu besin ağına göre aşağıdakilerden hangisi <b>doğrudur</b>?</p>",
   "c": [
    "Yılan bu besin ağında yalnızca otla beslenen birincil tüketicidir.",
    "Şahin bu ağda yalnızca tek bir besin zincirinde yer alır.",
    "Çekirgelerin sayısı azalırsa kurbağaların sayısı hızla artar.",
    "Fare hem ot (bitkisel) hem de çekirge (hayvansal) ile beslendiği için hepçil bir canlıdır."
   ],
   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Oklar enerjinin aktarım yönünü gösterir: ok, yenenden yiyene gider.</li> <li>Fareye ottan ve çekirgeden ok geliyor.</li> <li>Kurbağanın tek besini çekirge; yılana kurbağa ve fareden ok geliyor.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Besin ağına göre doğru ifade.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Oku doğru oku</b> Bir canlıya gelen oklar onun besinlerini, çıkan oklar onu yiyenleri gösterir. Bu yüzden her şıkta canlıya <b>gelen</b> oklara bakacağız.</li> <li><b>Farenin besinlerini bul</b> Fareye ottan (üretici, bitkisel) ve çekirgeden (tüketici, hayvansal) ok gelir. Hem bitkisel hem hayvansal besinle beslenen canlıya <b>hepçil</b> denir. <span class=\"sv-m\">Ot → Fare, Çekirge → Fare ⇒ Fare hepçil</span></li> <li><b>Diğer şıkları kontrol et</b> Yılana ottan ok gelmez; şahine birden çok canlıdan ok gelir; kurbağanın tek besini çekirgedir.</li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 180\" width=\"520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#fff\"/><defs><marker id=\"fe0ma\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#334155\"/></marker></defs><defs><marker id=\"fe0mg\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"30\" y=\"140\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#166534\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ot</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fef08a\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Çekirge</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"85\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Fare</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"85\" width=\"100\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fecaca\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"440\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Yılan / Şahin</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#fe0mg)\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"208\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#fe0mg)\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"388\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#fe0ma)\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"start\">bitkisel</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"start\">hayvansal</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2 kaynak → hepçil</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(1. tüketici)</text></svg><figcaption>Fareye hem üreticiden (ot) hem tüketiciden (çekirge) ok gelir.</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr><td>A</td><td>Yılana kurbağa ve fareden ok gelir; otla beslenmez, etçildir.</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>Şahin; tavşan, fare ve yılanla beslenir, birçok zincirde yer alır (ot → tavşan → şahin, ot → fare → şahin…).</td></tr><tr><td>C</td><td>Çekirge azalırsa tek besini çekirge olan kurbağa artmaz, <b>azalır</b>.</td></tr><tr class=\"ok\"><td>D</td><td>Fare hem ot hem çekirge yer → hepçil. Doğru.</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Ağda bir canlının beslenme türünü bulmak için ona <b>gelen</b> oklara bak: yalnız üreticiden → otçul, yalnız tüketiciden → etçil, ikisinden de → hepçil.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Okları “yer” anlamında ters okumak. Ok, enerjinin gittiği yönü gösterir; “Ot → Fare” fare otu yer demektir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
