   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Şema: Güneş → üreticiler → tüketiciler → ayrıştırıcılar; her basamaktan ısı çıkıyor.</li> <li>Ayrıştırıcılardan üreticilere mineraller, CO₂, azotlu bileşikler dönüyor.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>I, II ve III yargılarından doğru olanlar.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>I</b> Üreticiler fotosentezle ışık enerjisini besindeki kimyasal enerjiye dönüştürür ✓.</li> <li><b>III</b> Her basamak enerjinin büyük kısmını kullanır ve ısı olarak kaybeder; karbon ve azot gibi maddeler ise canlılarla çevre arasında döner ✓.</li> <li><b>II</b> Ayrıştırıcılar <b>maddeleri</b> (mineral, CO₂, azotlu bileşik) geri kazandırır, <b>enerjiyi</b> değil. Aldıkları enerji de sonunda ısı olur. Enerji döngü yapmaz ✗.</li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 195\" width=\"520\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"195\" fill=\"#fff\"/><defs><marker id=\"fe84my\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/></marker></defs><defs><marker id=\"fe84mr\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/></marker></defs><defs><marker id=\"fe84mg\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"60\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fde047\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Güneş</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"45\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#166534\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Üreticiler</text><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"77\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#fe84mr)\"/><text x=\"165\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ısı</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"45\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fef08a\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Tüketiciler</text><line x1=\"305\" y1=\"77\" x2=\"305\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#fe84mr)\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ısı</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"45\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"445\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Ayrıştırıcılar</text><line x1=\"445\" y1=\"77\" x2=\"445\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#fe84mr)\"/><text x=\"445\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ısı</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"108\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fe84my)\"/><line x1=\"222\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"248\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fe84my)\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"388\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fe84my)\"/><path d=\"M485,77 L485,152 L128,152 L128,79\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fe84mg)\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">madde döner (mineral, CO₂, azot) – enerji dönmez</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Enerji tek yönlü akar ve ısı olarak çıkar</text></svg><figcaption>Sarı: enerji akışı · Kırmızı: ısı kaybı · Yeşil: madde döngüsü.</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr><td>A</td><td>III de doğru; eksik.</td></tr><tr><td>B</td><td>II yanlış: enerji geri kazanılmaz.</td></tr><tr class=\"ok\"><td>C</td><td>I ve III. Doğru.</td></tr><tr><td>D</td><td>II yanlış.</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Altın kural: <b>Madde döner, enerji akar.</b></div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
